{"description":"Register intent to edit code BEFORE editing. Returns any collisions with other active agents. Call this first, always. Also pass `reads`: the declarations you consulted to write this \u2014 the functions, methods or types you are calling or implementing against. Tower tells you when one of them changes under you, and shows the old and new signature so you can patch your call sites without re-reading the file. If you are changing a symbol's signature, set `declares` on it to the new declaration as it will read in the source, up to the body (e.g. `function verify(token: string, opts: Opts): boolean`): agents whose work reads it are handed that contract immediately and can code against it in parallel instead of waiting for you. If the claim is refused, the response carries `alternatives`: what to avoid, and advice. Don't stop \u2014 work outside `avoid`; Tower messages you when it frees up.","execution":{"taskSupport":"forbidden"},"inputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"agentId":{"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"branch":{"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"etaMinutes":{"exclusiveMinimum":0,"type":"integer"},"files":{"default":[],"items":{"type":"string"},"type":"array"},"force":{"type":"boolean"},"projectId":{"type":"string"},"purpose":{"default":"","type":"string"},"reads":{"items":{"$ref":"#/properties/symbols/items"},"type":"array"},"repo":{"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"repoId":{"type":"string"},"symbols":{"default":[],"items":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"declares":{"maxLength":240,"type":"string"},"file":{"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"kind":{"enum":["function","class","method","type","file"],"type":"string"},"sig":{"type":"string"},"sigText":{"maxLength":240,"type":"string"},"symbol":{"type":"string"}},"required":["file","symbol"],"type":"object"},"type":"array"}},"required":["agentId","repo","branch"],"type":"object"},"name":"claim_intent","outputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"alternatives":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"advice":{"type":"string"},"avoid":{"items":{"$ref":"#/properties/conflicts/items/properties/overlap/items"},"type":"array"},"nextTask":{"anyOf":[{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"description":{"type":"string"},"id":{"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"module":{"minLength":1,"type":"string"}},"required":["id","module"],"type":"object"},{"type":"null"}]},"notifyOnRelease":{"type":"boolean"}},"required":["avoid","nextTask","notifyOnRelease","advice"],"type":"object"},"blocking":{"default":false,"type":"boolean"},"claimId":{"type":["string","null"]},"conflicts":{"items":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"agentId":{"type":"string"},"claimId":{"type":"string"},"declaredSigText":{"maxLength":240,"type":"string"},"etaMinutes":{"exclusiveMinimum":0,"type":"integer"},"kind":{"default":"write_write","enum":["write_write","write_read"],"type":"string"},"nowSigText":{"maxLength":240,"type":"string"},"overlap":{"items":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"declares":{"maxLength":240,"type":"string"},"file":{"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"kind":{"enum":["function","class","method","type","file"],"type":"string"},"sig":{"type":"string"},"sigText":{"maxLength":240,"type":"string"},"symbol":{"type":"string"}},"required":["file","symbol"],"type":"object"},"type":"array"},"reason":{"type":"string"},"severity":{"enum":["hard","soft","info"],"type":"string"},"wasSigText":{"maxLength":240,"type":"string"}},"required":["claimId","agentId","severity","reason","overlap"],"type":"object"},"type":"array"},"projectWarning":{"type":"string"},"recommendation":{"default":"proceed","enum":["proceed","stand_down"],"type":"string"},"unreadMessages":{"minimum":0,"type":"integer"}},"required":["claimId","conflicts"],"type":"object"}}
